  "prefLabel": "Puc 402.21 Transfer of customer base",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 402.21 \"Transfer of customer base\" means the acquisition through a sale or transfer of all or a part of the customer base of another carrier.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24",
